92186045417] [17592186389339 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "6b93df85-0b3c-5ded-8201-a97d95285f56" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389339 #edb/ref 1074 "The streamlines of a vector field are the level curves of its stream function and are tangential to the vector field at every point. \n\nIf $F$ represents the velocity field of a fluid flow, then they show the path traced out by a massless particle as it moves with the flow.\n\nA vector field $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$ with a simply connected domain $D⊆{R}^{2}$ has a stream function $ψ(x,y)$ if and only if\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}=0.\n$$\n\nNote that \n\n$$\nF(x,y)=2xi-2y\\,j\n$$\n\n is a vector field with simply connected domain $D,$ where $P(x,y)=2x$ and $Q(x,y)=-2y.$ Computing the partial derivatives, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}=2,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, $F$ has a stream function, since\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}=2-2=0.\n$$\n\nNext, we find a stream function. A function $ψ(x,y)$ is a stream function of the vector field $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$ if \n\n$$\nP=\\frac{∂ψ}{∂y},\\,Q=-\\frac{∂ψ}{∂x}.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂ψ}{∂y}=2x,\\,\\frac{∂ψ}{∂x}=2y.\n$$\n\nIntegrating these equations, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\nψ(x,y)=2xy+f(x),\\,ψ(x,y)=2xy+g(y)\n$$\n\nwhere $f$ and $g$ are arbitrary functions. Finally, setting $f=g=0,$ we have\n\n$$\nψ(x,y)=2xy.\n$$\n\nFinally, we find the level curves of the stream function $ψ(x,y)=2xy$ given by the equations $ψ(x,y)=c.$\n\nNotice that the range of $ψ(x,y)$ is $(-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ So, we will consider level curves for any value of $c.$ So, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ψ(x,y) & =c \\\\ 2xy & =c \\\\ y & =\\frac{c}{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation above gives us a family of hyperbolas with asymptotes $y=0$ and $x=0$ and, for $c=0,$ the lines $y=0$ and $x=0.$ Therefore, the correct graph (along with the vector field $F$) is as follows:\n\n![](images/24/24c6dadd4f980121a36929a9cdb800f7da8fac8eb84af40d595af89aa77b11ea.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389340 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389341 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389340 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389342 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389340 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389343 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389340 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389344 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389340 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389345 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389340 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389340 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389340 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186389344 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389340 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "ce55e1ed-b422-5201-909f-65fba9887b50" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389341 #edb/ref 1080 "images/6a/6a1ce9b96f0bca4ec14e7ce60e5cebd72efc4421acfd4a65ba55e9c8a7d1d352.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389341 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389341 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bc9bdb8d-ad2b-5d91-86ca-825ec11037fa" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389342 #edb/ref 1080 "images/07/0799c425e6b33f2be8f115d7d0de9e5607bdef9f094a02381fc5197839d80d75.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389342 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389342 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "678a4e30-3832-553e-8ea1-b4ab930f1cd6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389343 #edb/ref 1080 "images/95/95fee99b51dc07130717569fcb90ab5e210bf2cc64811f536dc493e9c3e1588e.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389343 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389343 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6db4de8e-dbc7-51ee-8ae9-5b089f44fbf6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389344 #edb/ref 1080 "images/3a/3a3ef451c7e25ff33fb1820d5b8c98e10038c4ee058f627d93acf72989b7b794.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389344 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186389344 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "92bd4bba-9b1d-550f-a3d8-850c5ca8fd4d" #edb/re